  "details": "Users sometimes go to the Group Public instance unexpectedly, and that causes trouble or \"social drama\". This can be mitigated if the app does not select a Group Public instance automatically.\n\nWhen you open the world detail page in-game, the app selects an instance as the default. I am unsure of the specification of how the app chooses the one, but it could be a Group Public instance.\n\nAlthough it is explicitly shown as Group Public, and users will see the popup message \"You have joined a Group Public instance\" when joining, people actually go to Group Public unexpectedly or accidentally.",
